    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Thank you for reading. A demo in English will be soon.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an amnesiac, piecing together fragmented memories to uncover the dark secrets both within yourself and hidden on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you notice that two of your regularly scheduled pills are missing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That night, your dreams overflow with bizarre visions\u2014the man who usually visits you on schedule transforms into a killer intent on ending your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, your therapist at the hospital has been replaced by a new doctor: gentle, caring\u2026 and unnervingly similar in appearance to your \u201cboyfriend.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >################################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this fragile emotional web, will you choose <strong>Grit</strong> or <strong>Faith</strong>?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >################################################################</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Parallel Routes</strong><br>Each of the two male leads has an independent storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>Your choices affect two hidden stats\u2014Grit and Faith\u2014and determine which of the 8 possible endings you\u2019ll reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong><br>Approximately <strong>5 hours</strong> of main-story content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >################################################################</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533290/extras/18c3867a4c21456d010eef048ad1ab18.avif?t=1751796715\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAKU</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weekly visitor and self-proclaimed boyfriend. He cares deeply about your well-being and always follows your requests without question\u2014yet he never forgets to check your medical records first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIRT:</strong> In your forgotten past lie fragments that have seeped into this world from the abyss. Silent and inscrutable, he seems bound by some unknown rule.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >################################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533290/extras/8f015311c418ac9e7c294f87d19dcb95.avif?t=1751796715\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ILAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newly assigned therapist\u2014gentle and attentive\u2014who claims to have worked on the Universal Reagent project. He insists that if you trust him, he can reveal the experiment\u2019s hidden records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAITH:</strong> The true origin of all things can be deceptively simple, but the path of discovery is lined with thorns. At the limit of trust, sacrifice and paradise may coexist\u2026 and perhaps regret is the only right choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >################################################################</p>",
